# L §8.3 LOAD-PATH (tally 2.1.1): "<path> doesn't exist", a path the run is given that names no file or folder.
# The run is given m.tally, which loads, and nope.tally, which doesn't exist (issue #13, T1's gap I-1: refcore crashed).
=== options disk missing=nope.tally
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "own"
input x: int

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  x = 1 "own"

ask q: x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PATH nope.tally doesn't exist
